    {
      "version": "0.3.0",
      "channel": "stable",
      "date": "2026-09-27",
      "status": "available",
      "source": {
        "repository": "https://github.com/DreamWeave-MP/greenmote",
        "tag": "0.3.0",
        "revision": "d11f51e56bce8ab09230460803eaa519a46391ad"
      },
      "notes": {
        "summary": "Unclip measures every reference against the real terrain and collision triangles of your load order, and only writes when asked.",
        "migration": "Unclip no longer writes unless you pass `--write`. Replace `--dry-run` with nothing, and\n`--write-actions` with `--actions`. In `greenmote.toml`, remove `[unclip]` keys the report warns\nabout; the Settings tab drops them when it saves.\n",
        "added": [
          "Every reference is measured directly: its mesh's base against OpenMW's triangle-split terrain, the texture OpenMW draws under it, the water plane, and the collision triangles of the statics around it. A reference inside a closed rock is recognised by ray parity.",
          "Burial is judged against plant height: the limit is the larger of `max_sink` units and `max_sink_fraction` of the mesh.",
          "A plugin outside every data folder brings its mod's `meshes` folder into the VFS, so a downloaded grass mod can be checked before it is enabled.",
          "References placed outside their own cell are deleted: OpenMW draws them only from far away.",
          "`--verbose` writes one line per reference to `greenmote-unclip.log`; `--structured` prints the report as JSON; `GREENMOTE_PROFILE=1` prints phase timings.",
          "The Unclip tab lists every `groundcover=` plugin in `openmw.cfg` with a checkbox and fixes the checked ones."
        ],
        "changed": [
          "Every write is reloaded and checked against the plan, and unclip run again on its own output plans nothing.",
          "Context plugins and occluder meshes load in parallel, and every reference is decided in parallel.",
          "openmw-config 2.0, vfstool_lib 0.10 and rapier3d 0.36."
        ],
        "fixed": [
          "Reference rotations compose as OpenMW composes them; references rotated about more than one axis were measured with the order reversed.",
          "A static moved or deleted by a later plugin no longer leaves a copy behind to clip against.",
          "Dependencies updated past a compile-time security advisory."
        ],
        "breaking": [
          "Unclip is a dry run by default again: `--write` rewrites the plugin in place, keeping `<plugin>.greenmote-original` and `<plugin>.bak`, and `--output-plugin` writes the rewritten plugin elsewhere. `--dry-run`, `--instances`, `--meshgenerator-ini`, `--origin-epsilon` and the `all` and `none` actions are gone; `--write-actions` is now `--actions`, and the old name still works.",
          "`float_tolerance`, `max_sink`, `max_sink_fraction` and `sink` replace `origin_epsilon`."
        ]
      },
