      "notes": {
        "summary": "First release: convert placed grass statics into OpenMW groundcover, and inspect groundcover for clipping, from a GUI or the command line.",
        "added": [
          "`greenmote convert`: matching exterior `STAT` references become `groundcover.omwaddon`, with `deleted_groundcover.omwaddon` hiding the originals and the meshes copied under `Meshes/grass/`.",
          "`greenmote unclip`: a groundcover plugin checked against terrain and statics, with `--write` for the `terrain-z`, `static-move`, `static-delete` and `orient` fixes.",
          "`greenmote.toml` settings, OpenMW config discovery, `--auto-enable`, and `greenmote.log`.",
          "A desktop GUI in English, French, German, Russian, Spanish and Swedish.",
          "Shell completions and a manual page."
